      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "$f(x) = ax$ و $f(-6) = -9$",
          "$a \\times (-6) = -9$ ومنه $a = \\dfrac{-9}{-6} = \\dfrac{3}{2} = 1{,}5$ ."
